==================================================

Learning Mode is for undergraduate students or visitors who may never have seen:

- a string inverter
- an IGBT
- a heat sink
- Raman scattering
- distributed temperature sensing
- thermal interface degradation
- SCADA
- predictive maintenance

The interface should teach through guided interaction.

Use simple language first, followed by the engineering term where useful.

